## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005, 120007, 120100, 16001
## Title: |cff00e5ffAuraUI|r Quickdraw
## Category: |cff00e5ffAura|rUI
## Group: AuraUI
## Notes: Hold a keybind to open a menu of actions; point or scroll to choose, release to fire.
## Author: Aura
## Version: 9.3
## Dependencies: AuraUI
## SavedVariables: AuraUIQuickdrawDB
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\AuraUI\media\aui-logo.tga

# Note: Bindings.xml (one binding per palette, routed to the secure buttons via
# SetOverrideBindingClick) is intentionally NOT listed here -- WoW auto-loads a
# file named Bindings.xml from the addon root, and listing it as well registers
# every <Binding> twice. Same reasoning as AuraUIActionBars.toc.
# The AUI_RADIAL binding ACTION names inside it predate the module's current
# name and stay for good: WoW stores keybinds against the action string, so
# renaming it would unbind every palette. Only the BINDING_HEADER/BINDING_NAME
# display strings carry the Quickdraw name.

# Main Lua
AuraUIQuickdraw.lua

# Options page lives in the LoadOnDemand AuraUIOptions addon.
